<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka's '96 manufacturing output up 7.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka's '96 manufacturing output up 7.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's manufacuturing output grew by 7.3 percent in 1996, lower than the 10.2 percent growth in the previous year, the Central Bank said in its annual report on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The downturn in growth was mainly due to the adverse impact of prolonged power cuts experienced due to drougnt, the report said.</p>
</text>
